snoring always wakes me up in the middle of the night. （我丈夫的鼾声常常在半夜里把我吵醒。）\n\n2. I stretch. 我伸展身体。\n也可以说 I stretch my arms.\n昨天的疲劳未除而仍然觉得很累时，可以说：I still feel stiff and tired (from yesterday's work/study). Stiff是指筋骨酸硬。\n相反，如果醒来时感觉很清爽就说 I feel great.\n\n3. I fold my quilt. 我叠好棉被。\n棉被也可以用 a bedding，毛毯是 blanket.\n叠好也可以说 fold up.\n铺开被褥是 I spread the bedding./ I lay out the bedding. / I make up the bedding.","bild_url":"https://fdfs.xmcdn.com/group72/M00/6B/A6/wKgO0F4Vz2mjJ6ViAACcsIi7aDo388.jpg","folgennummer":1,"kapitel_quelle":"modell"}